529722530,"text":"えっと…旅人、シトラリの顔にも「優しい」って書かれてたりしないよな？","nextNodeIds":[401730218]},{"nodeId":401730218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14603,"speakerName":"ルラ","textMapHash":1069389770,"text":"…あれ、なんか…","nextNodeIds":[401730219]},{"nodeId":401730219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14603,"speakerName":"ルラ","textMapHash":1044379722,"text":"気のせいかもしれないけど、シトラリ大祭司さまが透けて見える…","nextNodeIds":[401730220]},{"nodeId":401730220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14603,"speakerName":"ルラ","textMapHash":925615242,"text":"いや…きっと気のせいだ。ぼくに分かるわけが…","nextNodeIds":[401730221]},{"nodeId":401730221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":272579938,"text":"待て、これは…僕が使ってた巫術だ。ばあちゃんの本体は僕たちとだいぶ離れてる。いつの間に…","nextNodeIds":[401730222]},{"nodeId":401730222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1096,"speakerName":"シトラリ","textMapHash":2535297402,"text":"見えたでしょう？キミはスピリットの異常に少しだけ気づけたのよ。おめでとう。","nextNodeIds":[401730223]},{"nodeId":401730223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14603,"speakerName":"ルラ","textMapHash":2959491066,"text":"ほ…本当ですか？","nextNodeIds":[401730224]},{"nodeId":401730224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":2230641530,"text":"でも、どこに行ったんだ？","nextNodeIds":[401730225]},{"nodeId":401730225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1096,"speakerName":"シトラリ","textMapHash":1791409962,"text":"バカね、釣りに決まってるじゃない。","nextNodeIds":[401730226]},{"nodeId":401730226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1096,"speakerName":"シトラリ","textMapHash":2449533378,"text":"洞窟に設置したワナにかかったやつがいるの。あの谷中ってやつよ。","nextNodeIds":[401730227]},{"nodeId":401730227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2961271418,"text":"なんだって？","nextNodeIds":[401730228]},{"nodeId":401730228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1096,"speakerName":"シトラリ","textMapHash":2455180474,"text":"詳しいハナシはまた後で。洞窟に来てちょうだい。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4017302,0],"PAIN